# The allowlist accepts an assembled distribution only.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!distribution.json
!sources.receipt.json
!product.receipt.json
!product.qualification.json
!product/
!product/**
!container/
!container/**
!runtime/
!runtime/bun
!runtime/bun-cosmic
!runtime/*.json
!sources/
!sources/**
!wasm/
!wasm/**
!arch/
!arch/rootfs.tar
!arch/rootfs.receipt.json
# Sources are exported from Git's tracked inventory by the staging owner.
# Preserve tracked fixture paths, including node_modules, PEM and dotenv files.
# Provider stores and Git administration are never distribution source.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.codex/sessions
**/.codex/sessions/**
**/.claude/projects
**/.claude/projects/**
